What is Genuts Framework?
-------------------------
 Genuts API provides a consistent Java framework for game development.
It contains a library with classes primarily intended for sprite-based
games conception, including functions for sprite manipulation and
collision detection.
 Additionally, Genuts API will provide a level of abstraction for some
of Java's game-related API, such as images manipulations and event
handling.
 Genuts API is compatible with Java 1.1 & Java 2.

